world  cup

floor
  size      6 m
  friction  0.8, spinning 0.005, rolling 0.002

ramp
  is a      ramp
  high end  1 m up
  low end   1.6 m along, 45 cm up
  width     40 cm

ball
  is a      sphere 6 cm radius, 200 g
  rolls
  bounce    dead
  friction  0.8, spinning 0.01, rolling 0.004
  moves     freely
  rests     on ramp, 12 cm from the top

cup
  is an   open box
  length  90 cm
  width   60 cm
  walls   30 cm
  stands  on floor, 2.05 m along

expect
  ball touches ramp
  ball comes to rest in cup
